  "title": "AXIL Brands Launches Full Line of Reviv3 Procare® Products in Chatters Salons Across Canada",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, September 18, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AXIL Brands, Inc. (“AXIL” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: AXIL), an emerging global consumer products company for AXIL® hearing protection and enhancement products and Reviv3® hair and skin care products, announces the launch of its full Reviv3 Procare® product line in Chatters, Canada’s largest professional haircare retailer with more than 115 salons across seven provinces.",
